# A buggy portal (GATE_BUGGY) goes where it says unless number_percent() comes under 5; then it's a random room.
# Seed 20 makes that draw come under 5 (found by trying seeds on the Python game; the C must agree), and Locksmith
# lands in room 6114 instead of the temple.
@seed 20
@connect lock
Locksmith
psswrd
@return
@obj 25 3110 0 0 8 3001 -1
enter gate
@state
